Hi Yihui and the Knitr dev crew,
Kind of a strange and obscure bug with rmarkdown/knitr. When a line enclosed in brackets is set to echo by line number, it will be omitted, along with it's enclosing brackets. Alternatively, if a chunk with enclosing brackets has the line of the first enclosing bracket indicated as the specified line, it echoes, but other lines specified do not.
[Crossposting this to `yihui/knitr` since it's likely that where the issue occurs.](https://github.com/yihui/knitr/issues/1856) 

