 - [X]- If I'm filing a bug report, I have included a minimal, self-contained, and reproducible example, 
 - [X] have also included `xfun::session_info('knitr')`.
 - [X] I have upgraded all my packages to their latest versions (e.g., R, RStudio, and R packages), and also tried the development version: `remotes::install_github('yihui/knitr')`.
    - If I have posted the same issue elsewhere, I have also mentioned it in this issue.
- [X] I have learned the Github Markdown syntax, and formatted my issue correctly.

I understand that my issue may be closed if I don't fulfill my promises.

